        </profile>
        <profile id="90abc5ad-f34a-55f9-89f1-50ad6a142aa1" name="Boarding Forces Validation" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Boarding forces are bought against the ship’s Crew. Terminator/Dreadnought class limits are enforced; remember a Contemptor occupies 2 Crew slots.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="251c79f3-edd9-521e-8657-94017b606c03" name="Hardpoint Construction" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Bare chassis. Every mounted weapon is purchased separately. No upgrade-spend ceiling. Legal choices are controlled by hull class, hardpoint type and facing; each hardpoint must contain exactly one weapon.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      <profile id="f8a7bb23-96f8-48b8-b1fa-a51a36e0fa6a" name="Mount Capacity" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Port: 3 · Port Heavy: 2 · Starboard: 3 · Starboard Heavy: 2 · Prow Ordnance: 4 · Prow Super-Heavy: 1 · Dorsal: 4 · Defence: 8 · Hangar: 2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="28b86ad8-13ad-4d9d-a5a1-bac20492addb" name="Hardpoint Configuration" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Every physical weapon, defence and hangar hardpoint must be filled exactly once. There is no separate upgrade-spend cap; the hull's mount layout is the limit.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="514acfa3-bb07-412d-98a5-004bba9c754d" name="Roster Builder Summary" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Crew 8 · Port 3 · Port Heavy 2 · Starboard 3 · Starboard Heavy 2 · Prow Ordnance 4 · Prow Super-Heavy 1 · Dorsal 4 · Defence 8 · Hangars 2. Fill every physical hardpoint exactly once; aircraft are purchased separately up to Hangar capacity.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
